==Trivia==
*Twin Peaks may be a reference to the acclaimed horror television series of the same name.
*Going along with the "risqué" theme of [[Risqué Terrain]], Twin Peaks' Japanese name is Futa Kobu Iwa (フタこぶ岩). ''Iwa'' means "rock", ''futa'' means "two", and ''kobu'' means a lump or bump on one's body; ''futa kobu'' generally refers to two humps on a camel. Now imagine a rock shaped like two camel humps.

